<title>SWITZERLAND: Sulzer pledges details of Medica IPO.</title>
<headline>Sulzer pledges details of Medica IPO.</headline>
<dateline>WINTERTHUR, Switzerland 1997-05-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Engineering and technology group Sulzer AG said it would publish detailed conditions by early July for a planned stock flotation of unit Sulzermedica.</p>
<p>Speculation about the IPO conditions helped boost Sulzer's share price 3.5 percent to 1,245 Swiss francs at midday on Tuesday on the Swiss exchange, up 42 Swiss francs from Monday's close, traders said.</p>
<p>&quot;We will provide more detailed information in late June or early July at the latest,&quot; a Sulzer spokesman told Reuters when asked about the market rumours.</p>
</text>
